  <div class="wrap-narrow prose legal">
    <h1>Privacy.</h1>
    <p class="lede">The app has no account and no analytics. The painting happens on your Mac. This policy says exactly what Outbound and this website do with personal data, who handles it, and what you can ask of us.</p>
    <p class="updated">Last updated 2 November 2026</p>

